            "category": "description",
            "text": "Alien::FreeImage versions through 1.001 for Perl contains several vulnerable libraries.  Alien::FreeImage contains version 3.17.0 of the FreeImage library from 2017, which has known vulnerabilities such as CVE-2015-0852 and CVE-2025-65803.  The library embeds other images libraries that also have known vulnerabilities.",
